From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] luma: frost and glass menus are smoked veils with white ink

0150 gave every surface over the wallpaper one ink and one shadow: under
frost and glass, white ink with a drop shadow, inherited from the
luma-surface class the material controller stamps on each surface root.
Popup menus carry that class too (the desktop menu, the dock and Well menus,
the calendar), but kept 0045's light frosted veils and their dark ink. The
shadow then smeared dark menu text into a blur, and labels that took the
inherited white ink (the calendar's date header) vanished on the light veil.

Frost and glass menus now use the same smoked veils as Quick Options
(rgba(28, 33, 40, 0.88) and rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.82)), white ink, the ledger's
smoked hover and pressed fills, and white separators, headings, ornaments
and sub-menus, in both variant sheets.
---
 data/theme/gnome-shell-dark.css  | 44 +++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 data/theme/gnome-shell-light.css | 44 +++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 2 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

diff --git a/data/theme/gnome-shell-dark.css b/data/theme/gnome-shell-dark.css
index 01e02ca..5139aad 100644
--- a/data/theme/gnome-shell-dark.css
+++ b/data/theme/gnome-shell-dark.css
@@ -3808,16 +3808,23 @@ StScrollBar {
   background-color: #252a30;
   border-radius: 15px;
   box-shadow: 0 24px 56px -18px rgba(12, 16, 21, 0.68); }
+/* Frost and glass menus are the same smoked veils as Quick Options, with the
+ * ledger's white ink and its shadow (0150): a light veil under that ink left
+ * dark text smeared by the shadow and white text on paper. */
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-content {
-  background-color: rgba(251, 251, 250, 0.90);
-  color: #2c343a; }
+  background-color: rgba(28, 33, 40, 0.88);
+  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
+  color: #ffffff; }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .luma-popup-shadow {
-  background-color: rgba(241, 242, 243, 0.01); }
+  background-color: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.01);
+  box-shadow: 0 24px 56px -18px rgba(14, 18, 24, 0.62); }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-content {
-  background-color: rgba(246, 244, 240, 0.82);
-  color: #2c343a; }
+  background-color: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.82);
+  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
+  color: #ffffff; }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .luma-popup-shadow {
-  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01); }
+  background-color: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.01);
+  box-shadow: 0 24px 56px -18px rgba(9, 15, 25, 0.76); }
 .background-menu { -arrow-rise: 0; }
 .background-menu .popup-menu-content { min-width: 204px; }
 .app-menu .popup-menu-content { min-width: 174px; padding: 5px; }
@@ -3842,11 +3849,12 @@ StScrollBar {
 .popup-menu-ornament { icon-size: 14px; color: rgba(242, 244, 246, 0.72); }
 .popup-menu-arrow { icon-size: 14px; color: rgba(242, 244, 246, 0.58); }
 
-/* Frost and Glass use shared light ink; nested panes do not own blur. */
+/* Frost and Glass menus carry the ledger's white ink; nested panes do not own
+ * blur. Hover, focus and the checked row take the ledger's smoked hover fill. */
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-item,
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-inactive-menu-item,
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item,
-.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-inactive-menu-item { color: #2c343a; }
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-inactive-menu-item { color: #ffffff; }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-item:hover,
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-item:focus,
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-item:selected,
@@ -3855,20 +3863,24 @@ StScrollBar {
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item:focus,
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item:selected,
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item:checked {
-  color: #2c343a; background-color: rgba(37, 46, 54, 0.06); }
+  color: #ffffff; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); }
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-item:active,
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item:active { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11); }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-item:insensitive,
-.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item:insensitive { color: rgba(44, 52, 58, 0.38); }
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item:insensitive { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-item.luma-menu-heading,
-.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item.luma-menu-heading { color: rgba(44, 52, 58, 0.46); }
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-item.luma-menu-heading { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72); }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-ornament,
-.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-ornament { color: rgba(44, 52, 58, 0.72); }
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-ornament { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84); }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-menu-arrow,
-.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-arrow { color: rgba(44, 52, 58, 0.58); }
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-menu-arrow { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76); }
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-separator-menu-item .popup-separator-menu-item-separator,
 .popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-separator-menu-item .popup-separator-menu-item-separator {
-  background-color: rgba(37, 46, 54, 0.105); }
-.popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-sub-menu { background-color: rgba(251, 251, 250, 0.94); }
-.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-sub-menu { background-color: rgba(246, 244, 240, 0.88); }
+  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); }
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-frost .popup-sub-menu,
+.popup-menu.luma-surface-glass .popup-sub-menu {
+  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
+  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10); }
 
